      "mutation_intent": "Keep the other vehicle close to the ego at spawn with a modest speed so the ego can end up in a colliding pose without requiring complex maneuvers, while maintaining perception/prediction activity and an unblocked planner path. Minimal environmental and mission changes preserve the uncertainty about whether the issue is in planning, control, or simulator timing.",
      "expected_oracle": "collision",
